!
!
! GLA/MIL98:  P. Glarborg, M.U. Alzueta, K. Dam-Johansen, and J.A. Miller; 
!             “Kinetic Modeling of Hydrocarbon/Nitric Oxide Interactions 
!             in a Flow Reactor”, Combust. Flame 115, 1-27, 1998
!
! GLA/BEN08:  P. Glarborg and L.L.B. Bentzen; “Chemical effects of a high 
!             CO2 concentration in oxy-fuel combustion of methane”, 
!             Energy Fuels, 22, 291-296 (2008) 
!
! RAS/GLA08a: C.L. Rasmussen, J. Hansen, P. Marshall, and P. Glarborg; 
!             “Experimental Measurements and Kinetic Modeling of CO/H2/O2/NOx 
!             Conversion at High Pressure”, Int. J. Chem. Kin. 40, 454-480 (2008)
!
! RAS/GLA08b: C.L. Rasmussen and P. Glarborg; “Measurements and Kinetic Modeling 
!             of CH4/O2 and CH4/C2H6/O2 Conversion at High Pressure”, 
!             Int. J. Chem. Kin. 778-807 (2008)
!
! RAS/GLA08c: C.L. Rasmussen, K.H. Andersen, K. Dam-Johansen, and P. Glarborg; 
!             “Methanol oxidation in a flow reactor: implications for the 
!             branching ratio of the CH3OH+OH reaction”, Int. J. Chem. Kin., 
!             40, 423-441 (2008)
!
! RAS/GLA08d: C.L. Rasmussen and P. Glarborg; “Sensitizing Effects of NOx on 
!             CH4 Oxidation at High Pressure”, Combust. Flame 154, 529-545 (2008)
!
! GIM/GLA09:  J. Gimenez Lopez, C.L. Rasmussen, M.U. Alzueta, Y. Gao, P. Marshall 
!             and P. Glarborg; “Experimental and Kinetic Modeling Study of 
!             C2H4 Oxidation at High Pressure”, Proc. Combust. Inst.32, 367-375 (2009)
!
! TIA/QI09    Z. Tian, Y. Li, L. Zhang, P. Glarborg, and F. Qi; “An experimental 
!             and kinetic modeling study of premixed NH3/CH4/O2/Ar flames at low 
!             pressure”, Combust. Flame 156, 1413-1426 (2009)
!
! GLA/MAR09   P. Glarborg and P. Marshall; “The rate constant for the CO+H2O2 
!             reaction”, Chem. Phys. Lett. 475, 40-43 (2009)
!
! MEN/GLA09   T. Mendiara and P. Glarborg; “Ammonia chemistry in oxy-fuel combustion 
!             of methane”, Combust. Flame 156, 1937-1949 (2009)
!             T. Mendiara and P. Glarborg; “NO reduction in oxy-fuel combustion of 
!             methane”, Energy Fuels 23, 3565-3572 (2009)
!
! GER/GLA10   S. Gersen,  A.V. Mokhov, J.H. Darmeveil, H.B. Levinsky, and P. Glarborg;
!             “Ignition promoting effect of NO2 on methane, ethane and methane/ethane 
!             mixtures in a Rapid Compression Machine”, Proc. Combust. Inst., 
!             submitted (2010)
!
! GIM/GLA10   J. Giménez-López, M.U. Alzueta, C.L. Rasmussen, P. Marshall, and 
!             P. Glarborg; “High pressure oxidation of C2H4/NO mixtures”, 
!             Proc. Combust. Inst., submitted (2010)
!
! ZHA/QI10    K. Zhang, Y. Li, T. Yuan, J. Cai, P. Glarborg, and F. Qi; 
!             “An experimental and kinetic modeling study of premixed nitromethane 
!             flames at low pressure”, Proc. Combust. Inst., submitted (2010)
!
 ELEMENTS
    O  H  C  N  AR
 END  
!
 SPECIES
!    
! *** H2 ***
!    
H  O  OH  H2  O2  HO2  H2O  H2O2            
!    
! *** CO ***
!    
CO CO2 HOCO 
!    
! *** C1-hydrocarbons ***
!    
CH4 CH3 CH2 CH2(S) CH C
CH3OH CH3O CH2OH CH2O HCO 
!atm CH3OOH CH3OO CH2OOH 
 CH3OOH CH3OO CH2OOH 
!    
! *** C2-hydrocarbons ***
!    
C2H6 C2H5 C2H4 C2H3 C2H2 H2CC C2H C2
CH3CH2OH CH3CH2O CH3CHOH CH2CH2OH CH3CHO CH2CHOH CHCHOH HCCOH 
CH3CO CH2CHO CH2CO HCCO C2O OCHCHO
!atm cC2H4O cC2H3O CH3CH2OOH CH3CH2OO CH3CHOOH CH2CH2OOH CH2CHOOH CH2CHOO CYCOOC. HOCH2CH2OO
!atm OOCH2CHO HOOCH2CO OCH2CHO
 cC2H4O cC2H3O CH3CH2OOH CH3CH2OO CH3CHOOH CH2CH2OOH CH2CHOOH CH2CHOO CYCOOC. HOCH2CH2OO
 OOCH2CHO HOOCH2CO OCH2CHO
!
! *** C3-hydrocarbons ***
!    
C3H6 CH2CHCH2 CH2CCH3 CH3CHCH CH3CCH2 H2CCCH2 H3CCCH cC3H4 H2CCCH C3H2 C3H
C2H5CHO C2H5CO CH2CHCHO CH3CHCO CH2CHCO
!
! *** H/N/O ***
!    
NH3 NH2 NH N 
N2H4 N2H3 N2H2 H2NN NNH  
NO NO2 NO3 N2O HNO HON HONO HNO2 H2NO HNOH HONO2
!
! *** cyanides ***
!    
HCN HNC CN HNCO HOCN HCNO NCO H2CN HCNH CH3CN CH2CN NCCN NCN  
!
! *** nitro-compounds ***
!    
CH3NO2 CH2NO2 CH3ONO CH3ONO2 
C2H5NO2 CH3CH2ONO CH2CH2NO2 CH3CHNO2 
!atm C2H3NO2 CHCHNO2 CHOCH2NO2
 C2H3NO2 CHCHNO2 CHOCH2NO2
CH3CH2ONO2 
!
! *** nitroso-compounds ***
!    
 CH3NO CH2NO C2H5NO 
 CH3CHNO C2H3NO CHCHNO ONCH2CHO CH3CONO ONCH2CH2OH
!
! *** hydrocarbon/amine-compounds ***
!    
CH3NH2 CH2NH2 CH3NH CH2NH HCNH H2CN
!
! *** inert ***
!    
AR N2
!
 END
